      <title>GTCR在波动市场的Osttra接近32亿美元的交易</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/gtcr-is-said-to-near-deal-to-buy-osttra-for-about-3-2-billion</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据知情人士称，私募股权公司GTCR即将达成一项交易，以大约32亿美元的价格购买贸易后服务公司Osttra，这表明仍然可以出售关税的公司。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/gtcr-is-said-to-near-deal-to-buy-osttra-for-about-3-2-billion</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 10:53:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>意大利的乔治蒂（Giorgetti）说，尽管增长较低，但没有额外的借款</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/italy-s-giorgetti-says-no-extra-borrowing-despite-lower-growth</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据财政部长吉安卡洛·吉尔盖蒂（Giancarlo Giorgetti）称，尽管经济增长估计较低，但意大利仍不需要额外的借贷。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/italy-s-giorgetti-says-no-extra-borrowing-despite-lower-growth</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 10:50:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>挪威的财富基金计划支持帕斯奇的Mediobanca出价</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/norges-plans-to-back-paschi-s-mediobanca-bid-at-investor-meeting</link>
      <description><![CDATA[挪威的主权财富基金在Banca Monte dei Paschi di Siena Spa拥有超过2.5％的股份，计划在下周举行的重要投资者会议上支持意大利银行对竞争对手Mediobanca Spa的竞标。]]></description>
