      <title>亿万富翁普拉达斯的继任计划由Versace Deal支持</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几十年来，凶猛独立的Prada Spa董事长Patrizio Bertelli谈到了意大利时装屋需要获得规模和规模，以占领LVMH和Kering SA等庞大的行业庞然大物，并避免被他们吞噬。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-12/billionaire-prada-clan-succession-plan-bolstered-by-versace-deal</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Peebles，McNeely筹集了办公室转换的基金</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/peebles-mcneely-to-raise-fund-for-office-to-housing-conversions</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一家由开发商Don Peebles和前Carlyle Group Inc.创立的新投资公司。合伙人道格·麦克尼利（Doug McNeely）寻求筹集多达15亿美元的资金，以将办事处转换为整个美国的住房。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/peebles-mcneely-to-raise-fund-for-office-to-housing-conversions</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
